  {
   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Handwriting Text\n\nWrites a string on, character by character, with a pen nib riding the wet edge of the ink and a slight hand-made tilt on every letter.\n\nCategory: typography. Length: 4 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A greeting, signature line or note should look written on by hand, letter by letter.\n- A personal, informal or craft tone.\n\nAvoid when:\n- You need to draw an actual stroke path (a logo or a real signature): draw an SVG path instead.\n- The text is long: a per-letter pen is slow for more than a short line.\n\nVariables:\n- text (string): Text, default \"Hello there\"\n- font_size (number, 24-260): Font size, default 130\n- color (color): Color, default \"#f4f4f5\"\n- font_weight (number, 100-900): Font weight, default 500\n- mode (enum): Split by, default \"chars\"\n- order (enum): Order, default \"start\"\n- stagger_frames (number, 0-20): Stagger, default 3\n- duration_frames (number, 1-90): Unit duration, default 10\n- delay_frames (number, 0-120): Delay, default 6\n- exit (boolean): Exit, default false\n- font (enum): Hand, default \"dancing\"\n- pen_size (number, 0-0.6): Pen size, default 0.14\n- pen_color (color): Pen color, default \"#f4f4f5\"\n- ink_softness (number, 0-1): Ink softness, default 0.18\n- wobble (number, 0-10): Wobble, default 1.6\n- seed (number, 0-999): Seed, default 1\n\nSource: https://github.com/riaz37/remotion-ui. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
